@testray.main.component.name = "Support QA"
@type = "koroneiki"

Feature: Koroneiki Account and Contact Role API
	Testing Koroneiki Account API functionality in relation to Contact Roles.

Teardown:
	* I tear down the contacts on koroneiki with the following email addresses
	| koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	| koroneiki.contact2@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	* I tear down the contact roles on koroneiki with the following names
	| Default Account Role  |
	| Default Team Role     |
	| Optional Account Role |
	| Optional Team Role    |
	* I tear down the teams on koroneiki with the following names
	| Development Team |
	| Marketing Team   |
	| Engineering Team |
	| Sales Team       |
	* I tear down the accounts on koroneiki with the following names
	| Koroneiki Auto Subsidiary |
	| Koroneiki Engr Subsidiary |
	| Koroneiki Automotive      |
	| Koroneiki Engineering     |

Scenario: Assign account contact role to contact
	Koroneiki contacts should be able to be assigned to account contact roles on teams.

	Given I create a contact on koroneiki with the following values
	| Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	| First Name    | Koroneiki                                |
	| Language      | English                                  |
	| Last Name     | Contact1                                 |
	| Middle Name   | User                                     |
	| Okta ID       | koroneikicontact1                        |
	And I create a contact role on koroneiki with the following values
	| Description | This is the default role for accounts |
	| Name        | Default Account Role                  |
	| Type        | Account                               |
	And I create an account on koroneiki with the following values
	| Code         | KORAUTO                                  |
	| Description  | Test automotive account on koroneiki     |
	| Fax Number   | 555-555-1234                             |
	| Industry     | Automotive                               |
	| Name         | Koroneiki Automotive                     |
	| Notes        | Additional account notes                 |
	| Phone Number | 555-555-5678                             |
	| Sold By      | Liferay US                               |
	| Status       | Approved                                 |
	| Tier         | Regular                                  |
	| Website      | www.koroneikiautomotive.com              |
	And I create a team with the name "Development Team" for the account "Koroneiki Automotive"
	And I assign contacts with the following email addresses to the team "Development Team"
	| koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	And I assign the contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken" on the team "Development Team" to the following roles	
	| Default Account Role |
	Then the contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken" assigned the team "Development Team" should have the contact role "Default Account Role"
	And the contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken" assigned the team "Development Team" should have the contact role "Member"

Scenario: Assign account contact role to contact via okta id
	Koroneiki contacts should be able to be assigned to account contact roles on teams via contact okta id.

	Given I create a contact on koroneiki with the following values
	| Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	| First Name    | Koroneiki                                |
	| Language      | English                                  |
	| Last Name     | Contact1                                 |
	| Middle Name   | User                                     |
	| Okta ID       | koroneikicontact1                        |
	And I create a contact role on koroneiki with the following values
	| Description | This is the default role for accounts |
	| Name        | Default Account Role                  |
	| Type        | Account                               |
	And I create an account on koroneiki with the following values
	| Code         | KORAUTO                                  |
	| Description  | Test automotive account on koroneiki     |
	| Fax Number   | 555-555-1234                             |
	| Industry     | Automotive                               |
	| Name         | Koroneiki Automotive                     |
	| Notes        | Additional account notes                 |
	| Phone Number | 555-555-5678                             |
	| Sold By      | Liferay US                               |
	| Status       | Approved                                 |
	| Tier         | Regular                                  |
	| Website      | www.koroneikiautomotive.com              |
	And I create a team with the name "Development Team" for the account "Koroneiki Automotive"
	And I assign contacts with the following okta IDs to the team "Development Team"
	| koroneikicontact1 |
	And I assign the contact with the okta ID "koroneikicontact1" on the team "Development Team" to the following roles	
	| Default Account Role |
	Then the contact with the okta ID "koroneikicontact1" assigned the team "Development Team" should have the contact role "Default Account Role"
	And the contact with the okta ID "koroneikicontact1" assigned the team "Development Team" should have the contact role "Member"

